# =============================================================================
# PRIVATE MATERIAL - must never be committed
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything committed here is world-readable, and
# stays readable by commit reference even after a later commit deletes it.
#
# The raw meeting recordings and transcripts contain personal data about named
# participants, including minors. The original slide decks carry speaker notes,
# embedded photographs, and author metadata that has not been cleared.
#
# All of that material lives OUTSIDE this repository, in:
#     ../lyceum-sources/
# Only the curated, board-safe record in data/ belongs here.
#
# The CI workflow enforces these rules as well, so a mistake fails the build
# rather than becoming permanent. Do not remove either the rules or the check.
# =============================================================================

# Raw meeting transcripts and recordings
Lyceum*.md
transcripts/
*.vtt
*.srt

# Source presentation decks and office documents
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf

# Review and distribution archives
*.zip

# Credentials and secrets - never create these in the working tree
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.gitToken.txt
.recovery-codes.txt

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling and editor cruft
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Claude Code session history (local working notes, not project source)
.cc-history/

# Build and preview artifacts
_site/
dist/
node_modules/
_preview_*.png
index_preview.png

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
